<title>UK: Bradstock year pre-tax profits rise 13 pct.</title>
<headline>Bradstock year pre-tax profits rise 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr  (pence)		6.8		    vs 5.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  4.1		    vs 4.1</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  5.7		    vs 5.7</p>
<p> Turnover		    36.2		   vs 33.4</p>
<p> Pretax			6.9		    vs 6.1</p>
<p> Operating result	  4.2		    vs 3.5</p>
<p> Investment/other income 2.4		    vs 2.9</p>
<p>Full company name - Bradstock Group Plc.</p>
